      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `2ac9a8490dbf24f0e7d80f2504653fcfb4acf3c55e5ad48c76908b7e90ddeb73--14.-family-and-domestic-violence-experimental-data-fdv-tables-1-to-17-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2018-19\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 18 of 18\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6c48981ed0697dad8a391013b138841e3c05754233fe5221a5dfeb5db03113cc | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 1\" | cfd159cdde9a344028f4288bd6e951dbf74a40a7b29a0fb008667dbcd87db0db | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 2\" | db47eac02b6910b4973f481f8346fffe7f8ca5b6c2adce27d0f27316e42f9988 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 3\" | 840caedbdca27446ceb566ca0f427cbabab4fb3db4d74af3560558023bb90429 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 4\" | 5542ee7a65293682a8b2a7b3f40d125503388f15961094695a69f2da4315ab28 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 5\" | 7cf238e5846ff948f71013a3ae4cabb8aa5561bc586d4a2db3acc30522ed55b5 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 6\" | c25801945889a9dbf89cc3f133021bf2533db6ce4fdcd19da7fc15c5d99f845d | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 7\" | 969e3cb5ad98e635580b2173851a183606fb414c4c6bde3e4260ca9a95eed7c3 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 8\" | 0d9eb5d60c012ed69009d229a89d04b859bc9f37ae45d644901a008056ebf2ee | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 9\" | cb00defd8a04d36bcc46680b4104ea555634717133e450864357bf2bfb865884 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 10\" | 4ed8f82ba8647ecfa1a13a8d907e5d06f036fa1fa75f97ebe8f4be87e20a4c2a | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 11\" | 63182df648854a1913f9ea64669b4d0fb0c5ff38b5c14fbd2deb0d4044a91eee | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 12\" | b234d8bb1b0c2ec43cfeeb42634f137838a78278c7b8e71863c0f22cb43057d3 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 13\" | 0befdb46816a248b40d2a99fc7119ef08028d1c9a6ed055d38ac2fcf4d3388ab | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 14\" | 58d8b230318037a1ed8f92bc9d4af3ab8b94f3dc766c493251579fb9b8396742 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 15\" | 688fe1d39aeafcffa8466ddca4b27233eea7d413bcc83195839f99c8796ea09e | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 16\" | ce787cda25f7c759c2068701cb85852bea7f611d4044d0e261534ed5f0227c88 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 17\" | e3cbbe51d8a439ea870ffddd6dc27607789d75105089ada98262e3a12942ba07 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
